{"id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-inference-rule.md","title":"Inference-Rule Instance Space","display":"df-inference-rule — Inference-Rule Instance Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-inference-rule","aliases":["92-df-inference-rule"],"display":"df-inference-rule — Inference-Rule Instance Space","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]"],"source":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）","source_status":"原书有限推理规则的本地一般空间"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-inference-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-inference-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inference-rule — Inference-Rule Instance Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书有限推理规则的本地一般空间"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> (definition-target space of rule instances)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\mathrm{InfRule}_G \\coloneqq (\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\mathrm{InfRule}_G \\coloneqq (\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\(r=(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> : 一个具体的推理规则实例</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> : 一条推理规则（规则实例的集合）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>是规则的前提数量</li>\n<li>Modus Ponens 的每个实例有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=2\">\\(k=2\\)</span> 个前提</li>\n<li>Generalization 的每个实例有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1\">\\(k=1\\)</span> 个前提</li>\n<li>推理规则是形式系统的核心组件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书 P.E. 只有二前提 MP 和一前提 Gen；本文给一般有限前提空间。原书两个具体规则集已在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"920841c1841d30c3\" href=\"?note=920841c1841d30c3\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems\">92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems</a> 逐项定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems","status":"resolved","id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书 P.E. 只有二前提 MP 和一前提 Gen；本文给一般有限前提空间。原书两个具体规则集已在 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] 逐项定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfRule}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inference\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\mathrm{InfRule}_G \\coloneqq (\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":true},{"tex":"r=(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=2","display":false},{"tex":"k=1","display":false}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InfRule}_G$ (space of rule instances, see [[92-df-inference-rule]])"},{"id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InfRule}_G$ (space of rule instances, see [[92-df-inference-rule]])"},{"id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InfRule}_G$ (space of inference-rule instances, see [[92-df-inference-rule]])"},{"id":"9d1ed3f87b156ecf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G$ (inference rule, see [[92-df-inference-rule]])"},{"id":"166aa997e9977c14","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"该规则可以如上精确定义，但它有可数无穷多个前提，因此不属于[[92-df-inference-rule]]所固定的有限前提实例空间，也不产生通常的有限有效证明系统"},{"id":"2ed5fae1d0439ed4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G$ (system-$G$ rule-instance set and its ambient space, see [[92-df-inference-rule]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-inference-rule]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-inference-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","920841c1841d30c3"]}